ized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"glowing long sword","source_tag":"_t","target":"光辉的长剑"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"773127d0181f405a96088bc481009c1635c02d1fef2f13a614ce84fe629bc0a9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff98c01bb52807ecc4542900c938966404ef8dbbbe2eb850ad69c3cc39b42330","logical_entry_identity":"23c851f0b3094c397dbdbfe24d618b3b579be98b378779ab0e7be5b4bec8c40a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Make a melee attack for %d%% damage and then attempt to grapple a target up to one size category larger than yourself for %d turns. A grappled opponent will be unable to move, take %d damage each turn, and %d%% of the damage you receive from any source will be redirected to them as physical damage.\n\t\tAny movement from the target or you will break the grapple. Maintaining a grapple drains %d stamina per turn.\n\t\tYou may only grapple a single target at a time, and using any targeted unarmed talent on a target that you're not grappling will break the grapple.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"对目标进行一次近战攻击，造成 %d%% 武器伤害并抓取目标（可抓取目标的身材最多比你大 1 级）持续 %d 回合。被钳住的对手将无法移动，每回合受到 %d 物理伤害，同时你从任何来源受到的伤害的 %d%% 将以物理伤害的形式转移至它身上。\n\t\t任何目标或你的移动将会打破抓取。维持抓取每回合消耗 %d 体力。\n\t\t同时你只能抓取 1 个目标，并且对任意一个你未在抓取中的目标使用指向性徒手技能均会打破抓取。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc5413b4cc86add92683aa598eaa205de0bf98211ff253b0e384fe4e5f6dc891","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff9a409a1023a6f9816e510fec10702b3f3e26c93c45a30bd0544d67d712e4c6","logical_entry_identity":"2aec48a843cd2c8fbec58327e81930f0e72b460ebc521a4bd9dca4649c8a7b34","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have a special affinity for darkness and shadows.\n\t\tWhen standing in an unlit grid, the minimum range to your foes for activating stealth or for maintaining it after a Shadow Dance is reduced by %d.\n\t\tWhile stealthed, your life regeneration is increased by %0.1f (based on your Cunning) and your stamina regeneration is increased by %0.1f.  The regeneration effects persist for %d turns after exiting stealth, with 5 times the normal rate.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你对黑暗和阴影有特殊的亲和力。\n\t\t站在未照明的地格中时，激活潜行或在暗影之舞结束后维持潜行所要求的敌人最小距离减少 %d 格。\n\t\t潜行时，生命回复提高 %0.1f（基于灵巧），体力回复提高 %0.1f。退出潜行后，这些回复效果仍会以五倍强度持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b56524fffb71b0a540626389b1d4caa3e36602214a694cc4de0bc014ee344bb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff9a768a12d180ad9e034acb75505f483bb4670873372051562ac5ae00db07c3","logical_entry_identity":"27bf0f3e8abf42ebd97a7e8d89dc232976c4356a871bb70179ee62223dfc11d0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#YELLOW#I HAVE LITTLE PATIENCE FOR TIME WASTERS. THIS SHALL BE THE LAST TIME WE SPEAK.","source_tag":"chat","target":"#YELLOW#我对浪费时间的人毫无耐心。这将是我们最后一次对话。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"909a0e413d398a745c7fe122b2cfd3a7f716a974b0feff0af84bf99fe946cdfb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ff9dc7193b384ce2daaa76f784add5053d3aaa65a85d26840f938e11c44d08fd","logical_entry_identity":"6cd2f4c68dbc74af7c7477756171f4682d1c45db6d2a3573af408318dfda4cbd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sweep","source_tag":"talent name","target":"横扫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7ec1d0b52b89250db1bbaf8d8a6c4098947b995dca98c9b2a35a21fc4d1a68b2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ffa46b9d5b10da22b06553055be4a4030fefb4a53aa4811273c703aae6eae08a","logical_entry_identity":"af4a6071d5e6f628669dc4c805c6bb7451bd78d549859e63621e681f5e542f64","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"When you avoid a melee blow from an adjacent foe, you have a %d%% chance to get a free, automatic melee attack against the attacker for %d%% damage, up to %0.1f times per turn.\n\t\tUnarmed fighters using it will also attempt to throw the target to the ground if the attack lands, dazing them for 2 turns or stunning them for 2 turns if the target is grappled.\n\t\tThe chance of countering and number of counter attacks increase with your Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当你躲开相邻敌人的近战攻击时，有 %d%% 几率对攻击者自动发动一次不消耗回合的近战反击，造成 %d%% 伤害，每回合最多触发 %0.1f 次。\n\t\t徒手战士的反击命中后还会尝试将目标掀翻在地，使其眩晕 2 回合；若目标正被擒抱，则改为震慑 2 回合。\n\t\t反击几率和每回合反击次数随灵巧提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ad438d6e6c3c481385ef3c330b0bf2d34c999c5df2ea52995182a210826949cf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ffa77aef82eb16f84cf30296ac11291883baae8a494cbb97b9b5a686459bb60f","logical_entry_identity":"bd622e72c531e752e9b39f26534a06707dcab5266d98873475ee9456da205c7d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"a letter to Borfast from the Master","source_tag":"_t","target":"领主写给波法斯特的信"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eaeb1cbd6b573e25da8d1a7a862e11189f4195c89c774d9af7bfcad725f4f760","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ffabe8c742777212c6c91680f87e203be771324bb9e635c46ec782c27d7551a7","logical_entry_identity":"4925f1480c76102cf22748f6a2148d9c9f00a6ad7e828e0e5687b6d0a66b9bc3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"lite","source_tag":"damage type","target":"光照"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc32decf9802e7a4a16afd8350bfe5b09eefb04ae143cd8ded80bcaf6f358b02","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ffb21cbabe123e93b9ee02e293275e62db165f3d815b9e29edd7aa08ea706076","logical_entry_identity":"27ce3ec2c7d3b24580019298f808a73bca7a006a4503d485065caa7e8dc5d1e5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Set action radius: %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"设置行动范围：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9ed09185dd89342077d1a4809d129e9de2e2226660064ff7a67dda3ed2e7acc2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ffb21dd4ccd3ada3cb0abcecd6ee531904750bce1b6d8b41fdc441b29cf91839","logical_entry_identity":"1adf092667a25f395e2442e5b2a5d485b21a297d3eb05af9db16041d53804b09","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# seems less dangerous.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#平静了下来。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a23ae09bafb23ddd1b0d240ccaaba3cf2edd332a3bf95182241ade1f280445bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ffb2a06200739d5d91a046df31c46f227e92e2fb4f95e0b1e681ab3848e8fe01","logical_ent